up this way, that it happened because of the way the bird was packed.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:36.400
Others suggested that maybe it roosted by hanging from them upside down.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.920
Nobody had any idea.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:45.660
In the years that followed, more specimens of this bird appeared and other artists made

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:55.040
a somewhat better job of depicting it.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:58.870
But the function of those strange 12 wires remained a mystery.

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:05.810
It was only on my second trip to New Guinea in 1997,

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:08.650
when we filmed the bizarre courtship of this bird,

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:12.200
for the very first time, that we found the answer.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:20.790
Courtship seems to be some kind of game,

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:24.320
a variation of "I'm the king of the castle", perhaps,

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:27.170
only with a very special prize.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:46.340
He deliberately brushed her face with his real quills.

00:21:46.340 --> 00:21:48.000
He's doing it again.

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:50.480
It seems that she prefers to be seduced

00:21:50.480 --> 00:21:58.990
